        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "White linen embroidered with colored silks.  In the middle are Adam and Eve on each side of a tree.  Above are angels, animals, flowers, conventional forms, and a wreath enclosing a crown, the initials \"C.W.H.G.\" and the date 1745.  Below are a man, two women, a child, animals, birds, flowers, letters and numbers. Stitches: cross, Italian cross, long-armed cross, Montenegrin cross, two-sided Italian cross"@en ;
